{"query":"OSIS beatbox","answer":"Osis, an Irish-Latvian beatboxer, won the 2022 Online World Beatbox Championship and was runner-up in the 2024 Grand Beatbox Battle. He is currently ranked second on the Beatbox Community. His performances are known for complexity and crowd appeal.","images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://www.beatboxcommunity.com/beatboxers/osis","score":0.8724455,"title":"Osis | Beatboxer Overview","content":"Osis, aka Oskar Svalbers is a beatboxer from Ireland. He is the 2022 Online World Beatbox Champion and is currently ranked 2nd on the official Beatbox Community","favicon":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8e1a68_d8e4dd0ad66c41d8a7a7a61c405bec41~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_180%2Ch_180%2Clg_1%2Cusm_0.66_1.00_0.01/8e1a68_d8e4dd0ad66c41d8a7a7a61c405bec41~mv2.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://beatbox.fandom.com/wiki/Osis","score":0.8536326,"title":"Osis | Beatbox Wiki - Fandom","content":"Oskar Svalbe, better known as Osis, is an Irish-Latvian beatboxer. He is half Irish and half Latvian.","favicon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/beatbox/images/4/4a/Site-favicon.ico/revision/latest?cb=20210713143910","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s9ePwCXM2Vk","score":0.70287734,"title":"M1XX1NG vs OSIS | FIERCE GLOBAL SOLO SEMI FINAL ...","content":"Osis, the current German Beatbox Championship Vice Champion, Grand Beatbox Battle Vice Champion, Online Beatbox Champion, Irish Beatbox","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/7330833b/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uXVGR0YXm0Q","score":0.657033,"title":"OSIS | Grand Beatbox Battle 2025: World League | Solo ...","content":"Representing Ireland , Osis returns to the Grand Beatbox Battle 2025: World League Solo Category after securing 2nd place at GBB24 and","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/7330833b/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.thewilkesbeacon.com/opinion/2025/11/12/the-icebox-gbb-2025-was-a-disaster","score":0.63179934,"title":"The Icebox: GBB 2025 was a disaster – The Beacon","content":"The final took place between these two beatboxers, and honestly I wouldn’t have it any other way. The rest of the roster had just been utterly disappointing, so it made sense these two would deserve to be in the final. 

My personal favorite beatboxers at the moment are Wing, Kaji, and Osis. Of course, I wanted Wing to be the champion. Unfortunately, PacMax came in with impressive rounds but only beat Wing three-to-two. [...] To explain why GBB25 had set such high expectations, it is important to understand who each of the contestants are. Let’s go through them in the order that they are listed on the official site.

Osis was the runner-up at GBB24, where he paved his way to the top through complexity and extremely rewatchable routines. His presence on stage was amazing and he won the crowd over with his sick beats. [...] Then, Osis lost to PacMax. I think Osis did not seem prepared enough for what PacMax had in store for him. It was unfortunate to witness, since Osis was one of my favorites for this year’s competition. He should have carried his momentum better.","favicon":"https://www.thewilkesbeacon.com/wp-content/themes/snoflex/images/favicon.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/p/Osis-Beatbox-100094242986582","score":0.6213807,"title":"Osis Beatbox","content":"Online World Beatbox Champion 🏆 Irish Beatbox Champion 🏆 GBB Vice. Achieve your beatbox goals with my direct guidance. Get custom notes tailored to YOU!","favicon":"https://www.facebook.com/favicon.ico","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/osisbbx","score":0.598524,"title":"Osis (@osisbbx) • Instagram photos and videos","content":"Grand Beatbox Battle Vice Champion Online World Beatbox Champion Irish Beatbox Champion osisbbx@gmail.com.","favicon":"https://www.instagram.com/favicon.ico","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YLQ4PZely1c","score":0.5928793,"title":"OSIS | GRAND BEATBOX BATTLE 2024: WORLD LEAGUE ...","content":"Check out the energizing debut of Osis at GBB24! As the first-place winner of the Grand Beatbox Battle wildcard contest, he's ready to","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/7330833b/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/@osisbbx","score":0.58777803,"title":"Osis","content":"Online World Beatbox Champion. EXCLUSIVE NEW OSIS VIDEO! Dlow Beatbox and Osis 27K. Swissbeatbox and Osis 311K","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/7330833b/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DXF9YTFkpAx","score":0.5265625,"title":"Osis beatbox combo tutorial #beatbox #tutorial #music #fyp ...","content":"Here's how you do the Osis 'Two Elements Combined' technique. You hit 'em with an inward rimshot. So... (sound). Hit 'em with a little sucker","favicon":"https://www.instagram.com/favicon.ico","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PLIEpfZXbnI","score":0.48440504,"title":"OSIS vs BOYETTE | INTENSE GLOBAL Solo Quarterfinal ...","content":"German Beatbox Championship 2026 – the biggest beatbox event in German history, live from Huxley's Neue Welt in Berlin with 1,200+ people in","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/7330833b/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://genius.com/Osis-beatboxer-cash-lyrics","score":0.4395795,"title":"Osis (Beatboxer) – Cash Lyrics","content":"Cash Lyrics: I want my money in cash / We cause jealousy, loosen up felonies / Whole crowd's telling me / Money in cash / You lot see me / Drunk melodies","favicon":"https://assets.genius.com/images/apple-touch-icon.png?1787167748","rawContent":null}],"requestId":"63941baa-e457-4880-b59f-f94efbcee06b","responseTime":1.77}

{"query":"CHEEZE beatbox","answer":"CHEEZE is a Chinese beatboxer who placed 3rd in the Solo category of the 2025 BeatPower United Beatbox Championship and competed in tag team events. He has performed in various competitions, including the Crossroads Beatbox Battle 2023 and the Online World Beatbox Championship 2025 Qualifier.","images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://beatbox.fandom.com/wiki/CHEEZE","score":0.8947989,"title":"CHEEZE - Beatbox Wiki - Fandom","content":"CHEEZE (Chinese Stagename: 熙诚), is a Chinese beatboxer. 3rd Place (Solo) – BeatPower United Beatbox Championship 2025 Top 4 (Tag Team, with JDY as Timbre,","favicon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/beatbox/images/4/4a/Site-favicon.ico/revision/latest?cb=20210713143910","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DDI0u8lNqYY","score":0.5931622,"title":"CHEEZE熙诚 丨 “Don't Cry In The Night” Beatbox Original - Instagram","content":"Watch these combos ➡️ Category: Tag Team ➡️ Timbre, the Carrier [Cheeze & Jdy] Knockout Stage: Elimination Round","favicon":"https://static.cdninstagram.com/rsrc.php/yr/r/rzWiSjZRxk5.webp","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/cheeze_bbx","score":0.54245186,"title":"CHEEZE熙诚 (@cheeze_bbx) • Instagram photos and videos","content":"362 followers · 469 following · 9 posts · @cheeze_bbx: “ YOTEETH BEATBOX a mediocre soul dreams to be an artist”","favicon":"https://static.cdninstagram.com/rsrc.php/yr/r/rzWiSjZRxk5.webp","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch%3Fv%3Dq_MQasxRgWo","score":0.50959414,"title":"Cheeze | Solo Elimination Round | Crossroads Beatbox Battle 2023","content":"Check out this elimination round from Cheeze at the Crossroads Beatbox Battle 2023! SUBSCRIBES are appreciated!","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/f13793d9/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch%3Fv%3DahCo2_B8bxc","score":0.48352703,"title":"SHIELD vs CHEESE | OWBC25 Qualifier #4 | Quarterfinal - YouTube","content":"Watch Shield beatbox battle Cheese in the last quarterfinal of the fourth Online World Beatbox Championship 2025 Qualifier,","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/f13793d9/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/blPgArFrADk","score":0.40768766,"title":"Cheetos Mac & Cheese Beatbox #beatbox #candy ... - YouTube","content":"Search "cheetos mac n cheese". @sophiabeatbox. Subscribe. Cheetos Mac & Cheese Beatbox #beatbox #candy #doritos #beatboxgirl #shorts #","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/f13793d9/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch%3Fv%3DXgO-pRJkDpM","score":0.3440251,"title":"MIKE vs CHEESE | January Wildcard Open BEATBOX BATTLE 2025","content":"Mike versus Cheese in the second quarterfinal of the Beatbox Community January Wildcard Open 2025! Want to Support BBXC?","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/f13793d9/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6aS-45G4_STDA3uk1JSrdA","score":0.33306974,"title":"Beatbox Community - YouTube","content":"Beatbox Community is the most active hub for beatbox battles and jams online🎤🔥 ・ vs CHEESE | OWBC25 Qualifier ・ 7:19 SHIELD vs CHEESE | OWBC25 Qualifier #4 |","favicon":"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/f13793d9/img/favicon_144x144.png","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://sporked.com/article/beatbox-flavors-ranked","score":0.1964563,"title":"BeatBox Flavors Taste Test! Check Out the Ranking | Sporked","content":"Before we get into what these little recyclable boxes of booze taste like, let’s talk about what exactly goes into them. BeatBox beverages are made with wine-based alcohol or malt-based alcohol. All of the flavors we tried are 11.1% ABV (that’s twice as boozy as a standard beer). They’re all vegan. And they’re sweetened with a mix of cane sugar, sucralose, and stevia. [...] `

BeatBox beverages are known for a few things—they’re low sugar, low carb, low cal, and not carbonated. But you probably know them best for their packaging. BeatBox flavors come in resealable boxes—like the kind coconut water comes in. And the boxes are extremely bright and colorful and covered in little illustrations. BeatBoxes are here to party.

## Videos by Sporked [...] :   This is the best BeatBox flavor out of all the BeatBox drinks we tried. It tastes like pineapple juice with a tropical undertone I can’t quite put my finger on—like coconut or guava. It’s really crisp and fairly understated for being a cocktail in a loudly colorful juice box. It’s like a less coconutty, more pineapple-y Pina Colada. It’s extremely drinkable and super refreshing. Enjoy it as is or freeze the heck out of it. Both Emily and I were really blown away by it. If you’re considering","favicon":"https://sporked.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/cropped-favicon.png?w=180","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/swissbeatbox/videos/watch-these-combos-%25EF%25B8%258F-category-tag-team-%25EF%25B8%258F-timbre-the-carrier-cheeze-jdy-knockout-/771634649318050","score":0.07391672,"title":"Alexinho · Zhang Ze Follow for more: @grand.beatbox ... - Facebook","content":"The Grand Beatbox Battle remains a global stage for artists to share their craft and help shape the future of beatbox culture. Thank you to all","favicon":"https://z-m-static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yj/r/rvjuhHLwc7B.ico","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DZE-MIkRQmK","score":0.06694044,"title":"Practicing my new beatbox technique for The DC villain Darkseid for ...","content":"Practicing my new beatbox technique for The DC villain Darkseid for my next cartoon beatbox battle episode. This is another one of those","favicon":"https://static.cdninstagram.com/rsrc.php/yr/r/rzWiSjZRxk5.webp","rawContent":null},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dc3S4eARC1K","score":0.062336873,"title":"This is going viral right now so I decided to do a crazy challenge. I ...","content":"How To Beatbox Try Walkgate — the app that locks your phone until you hit your daily step goal. Doomscroll less. Walk more. Your apps stay","favicon":"https://static.cdninstagram.com/rsrc.php/yr/r/rzWiSjZRxk5.webp","rawContent":null}],"requestId":"ee93d474-a299-4939-8d9d-67755539b